```mermaid
flowchart TD
    %% External Entry Point
    Client[Client Application] -->|registerModel Request| API[ModelMeshApi.registerModel]
    
    %% API Layer Processing
    API --> Validate{Validate Request}
    Validate -->|Invalid| ErrorResp[Return Error Response]
    Validate -->|Valid| Extract[Extract ModelInfo & Parameters]
    
    %% Core Registration Flow
    Extract --> CoreReg[ModelMesh.registerModel]
    CoreReg --> CheckReadOnly{Check Read-Only Mode}
    CheckReadOnly -->|Read-Only| ReadOnlyErr[Throw Exception]
    CheckReadOnly -->|Writable| RegFlow[Registry Operations]
    
    %% Registry Operations with Retry Loop
    RegFlow --> RegCheck{Check Model Exists}
    RegCheck -->|Exists| ValidateAttrs{Validate Attributes}
    ValidateAttrs -->|Mismatch| AttrErr[Throw InvalidInputException]
    ValidateAttrs -->|Match| UpdateTime[Update LastUsed Time]
    
    RegCheck -->|New Model| CreateRecord[Create ModelRecord]
    CreateRecord --> AtomicSet[registry.conditionalSetAndGet]
    AtomicSet -->|Conflict| RegFlow
    AtomicSet -->|Success| LogCreate[Log 'Added new model']
    
    %% Decision Point for Loading
    UpdateTime --> LoadDecision{loadNow = true?}
    LogCreate --> LoadDecision
    LoadDecision -->|No| RegComplete[Registration Complete]
    LoadDecision -->|Yes| EnsureLoaded[ensureLoaded]
    
    %% Model Loading Flow
    EnsureLoaded --> InternalOp[internalOperation]
    InternalOp --> InvokeModel[invokeModel - Main Routing]
    InvokeModel --> CacheCheck{Local Cache Check}
    
    CacheCheck -->|Hit| LocalExec[Execute Locally]
    CacheCheck -->|Miss| LoadBalance[Load Balancing Logic]
    
    LoadBalance --> PlacementOrder[PLACEMENT_ORDER Algorithm]
    PlacementOrder --> SelectInstance{Select Best Instance}
    
    SelectInstance -->|Local Instance| LocalLoad[Trigger Local Load]
    SelectInstance -->|Remote Instance| ForwardReq[Forward to Remote Instance]
    
    %% Local Loading Process
    LocalLoad --> CheckCapacity{Check Cache Capacity}
    CheckCapacity -->|No Space| EvictModels[Evict LRU Models]
    CheckCapacity -->|Space Available| LoadQueue[Add to Loading Queue]
    EvictModels --> LoadQueue
    
    LoadQueue --> TypeLoader[ModelLoader.loadRuntime]
    TypeLoader --> RuntimeLoad[Load in Model Runtime]
    RuntimeLoad -->|Success| UpdateCache[Update Local Cache]
    RuntimeLoad -->|Failure| LoadFailure[Record Load Failure]
    
    UpdateCache --> UpdateRegistry[Update ModelRecord in Registry]
    UpdateRegistry --> SyncDecision{sync = true?}
    
    %% Response Handling
    SyncDecision -->|Yes| WaitComplete[Wait for Load Complete]
    SyncDecision -->|No| AsyncResp[Return Async Response]
    WaitComplete --> FinalResp[Return Final Response]
    AsyncResp --> FinalResp
    LocalExec --> FinalResp
    ForwardReq --> FinalResp
    RegComplete --> FinalResp
    LoadFailure --> FailResp[Return Failure Response]
    
    %% Distributed Coordination
    subgraph "Distributed Storage"
        Registry[(Registry\nKV Store\netcd/ZooKeeper)]
        LocalCache[(Local Cache\nLRU)]
    end
    
    subgraph "Model Runtime"
        Runtime[External Model Runtime\nTriton/TorchServe/etc]
    end
    
    %% Storage Connections
    AtomicSet -.-> Registry
    UpdateRegistry -.-> Registry
    UpdateCache -.-> LocalCache
    RuntimeLoad -.-> Runtime
    
    %% Styling
    classDef entryPoint fill:#e1f5fe
    classDef processing fill:#f3e5f5
    classDef decision fill:#fff3e0
    classDef storage fill:#e8f5e8
    classDef error fill:#ffebee
    
    class Client,API entryPoint
    class CoreReg,Extract,RegFlow,CreateRecord,EnsureLoaded processing
    class Validate,CheckReadOnly,RegCheck,ValidateAttrs,LoadDecision,CacheCheck,SelectInstance decision
    class Registry,LocalCache,Runtime storage
    class ErrorResp,ReadOnlyErr,AttrErr,LoadFailure,FailResp error
```